      "translation_evidence": "The translation concerns the scalar translated profile and constant-coefficient advection equation.",
      "reasoning": "The selected passage and necessary ambient scalar context were independently inspected in the supplied rendering. The PDF hash is supplied by the locator, not independently verified."
